{"2880600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tired", "steam_appid": 2880600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for speed. Designed for precision. This is racing stripped down to its core by a solo developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/f325f1f9b45e48d012f30f0dcf9b9e8a.poster.avif?t=1787563923\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/f325f1f9b45e48d012f30f0dcf9b9e8a.webm?t=1787563923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/f325f1f9b45e48d012f30f0dcf9b9e8a.mp4?t=1787563923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cyberpunk time trial demo, you’ll take on 18 high-speed tracks with nothing in your way except your own limits, your ghost and a leaderboard to compete in. Just clean, responsive handling and the brutal pursuit of a faster lap trying to beat your own ghost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car customization</strong>: unique but simple, give your car a distinctive look and make it your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/262d91eeabd5b0ee38b242a7a64d13cc.poster.avif?t=1787563923\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/262d91eeabd5b0ee38b242a7a64d13cc.webm?t=1787563923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/262d91eeabd5b0ee38b242a7a64d13cc.mp4?t=1787563923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, the track, and the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Every second matters. Every mistake sticks. The difference between a smooth run and a reset is often a single input too late. Your biggest enemy? Your own skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/36b1e2238502d9c530c563b56f6c107c.poster.avif?t=1787563923\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/36b1e2238502d9c530c563b56f6c107c.webm?t=1787563923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/36b1e2238502d9c530c563b56f6c107c.mp4?t=1787563923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is about learning the lines, trusting your instincts, and pushing past your plateau. Instant restarts keep the momentum going, and tight controls mean no excuses.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for speed. Designed for precision. This is racing stripped down to its core by a solo developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/f325f1f9b45e48d012f30f0dcf9b9e8a.poster.avif?t=1787563923\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/f325f1f9b45e48d012f30f0dcf9b9e8a.webm?t=1787563923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/f325f1f9b45e48d012f30f0dcf9b9e8a.mp4?t=1787563923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cyberpunk time trial demo, you’ll take on 18 high-speed tracks with nothing in your way except your own limits, your ghost and a leaderboard to compete in. Just clean, responsive handling and the brutal pursuit of a faster lap trying to beat your own ghost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car customization</strong>: unique but simple, give your car a distinctive look and make it your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/262d91eeabd5b0ee38b242a7a64d13cc.poster.avif?t=1787563923\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/262d91eeabd5b0ee38b242a7a64d13cc.webm?t=1787563923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/262d91eeabd5b0ee38b242a7a64d13cc.mp4?t=1787563923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, the track, and the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Every second matters. Every mistake sticks. The difference between a smooth run and a reset is often a single input too late. Your biggest enemy? Your own skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/36b1e2238502d9c530c563b56f6c107c.poster.avif?t=1787563923\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/36b1e2238502d9c530c563b56f6c107c.webm?t=1787563923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/extras/36b1e2238502d9c530c563b56f6c107c.mp4?t=1787563923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is about learning the lines, trusting your instincts, and pushing past your plateau. Instant restarts keep the momentum going, and tight controls mean no excuses.</p>", "short_description": "High-speed sci-fi racing. Unlock 18 tracks. Master responsive controls, time the boost, instant resets, and online leaderboards. Four vehicles, car customization, high skill ceiling. Get good - race on prestige tracks. Passion project by a solodev.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/c81350a60e1df354091121e2d8fa86cfdcd61066/header.jpg?t=1787563923", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/56fd11b7f7769a76a33454ff3bec0255278a011d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787563923", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/56fd11b7f7769a76a33454ff3bec0255278a011d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787563923", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 6GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["EXHAUST3D"], "publishers": ["EXHAUST3D"], "demos": [{"appid": 3900610, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 899, "final": 899, "discount_